  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### How to use the Bulk Edit feature\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 18 Jan, 2021 at  4:33 PM\n\n\t\tClick here to watch the how to use Bulk Edit\n\nLocation: Bookkeeping module > Dashboard > Client specific > Tasks > Bulk Edits\n\nBulk Edit is a feature which allows you to re-code transactions to other nominal accounts. Head to the navigation above then search for the nominal code which has the transactions you would like to re-code.\n\nThen use the date filters to find the transactions by date. Once you have your list of transactions (as shown below) use the checkbox(s) to select the transaction(s) you would like to re-code.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000185558\">Bookkeeping Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to use the Bulk Edit feature\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 18 Jan, 2021 at  4:33 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/1add7d4f70a746189144157eca76a78c\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch the how to use Bulk Edit</a></span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Location:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> Bookkeeping module &gt; Dashboard &gt; Client specific &gt; Tasks &gt; Bulk Edits</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Bulk Edit</span> is a feature which allows you to re-code transactions to other nominal accounts. Head to the navigation above then search for the nominal code which has the transactions you would like to re-code.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Then use the date filters to find the transactions by date. Once you have your list of transactions (as shown below) use the checkbox(s) to select the transaction(s</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">) you would like to re-code.<br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/d0279261220242f8b2a7a4506397c4f0\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><br></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/d0279261220242f8b2a7a4506397c4f0\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://vimeo.com/325855176\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9120385337/original/n-vEaL__Z0GxJNmAJ_GdU00nKOvb8WEOCw.png?1610986834\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9120385337\"></span></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165226\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165226/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165226\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165226/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165226\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a cla